<title>JAPAN: Chugoku Marine -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chugoku Marine -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.71		vs	   11.97</p>
<p> Operating	  398    million	  vs	  183    million</p>
<p> Current	    627    million	  vs	  685    million</p>
<p> Net		  323    million	  vs	  367    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.07 yen	  vs	    4.63 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     79 million	  vs	  79 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.25 yen	  vs	    3.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Chugoku Marine Paints Ltd is a manufacturer of ship-bottom paints.</p>
